ed boundary coordinates or diagram pixels supply geometry. Independently digitized aerial centerline: 7011.3 m. Direction, historical configuration and fine corner alignment remain draft; no course coordinates come from the comparison catalogue.","Approximate 3D playback follows a boundary-normal midpoint path inside the unchanged supplemental inner and outer borders. The independently georeferenced 18 September 2026 Sentinel image corroborates this configuration at its native 10 m resolution, including the paved combined-course connector for Apex III; it does not verify fine edge positions or road widths. The original source trace, timing and border coordinates remain unchanged. Curbs are illustrative, raster terrain heights are estimated and banking is unknown.","Estimated constant-width corridor: width is stored in track.json; inner, outer and ideal lines are calculated in the browser from the mapped trace. Local widening and earlier boundary corrections are not retained by this approximation."],"model3d":{"schemaVersion":1,"pathMethod":"constant-width-trace-v1","startOffsetM":0,"referenceLengthM":6793.3,"elevationMethod":"periodic-monotone-cubic","elevation":[[0,360],[389.90242825607066,360.98],[545.8633995584989,360],[974.7560706401767,359],[1208.6975275938191,360.956],[1364.6584988962472,361],[1442.6389845474614,361.923],[1598.5999558498897,362],[1988.5023841059601,363.442],[2417.3950551876383,362.832],[2495.375540838852,362],[2651.3365121412808,361.904],[2729.3169977924945,361],[2963.258454746137,361.938],[3392.1511258278147,362.391],[3626.0925827814567,363.183],[3704.0730684326713,363.958],[4093.9754966887417,364.088],[4522.86816777042,365.97],[4600.848653421634,365.164],[4912.77059602649,363.572],[5068.731567328919,364.098],[5146.712052980132,365],[5341.663267108168,364.909],[5458.633995584989,364],[5731.565695364238,364],[5848.536423841059,363.009],[6004.497395143489,363],[6277.429094922737,360],[6793.3,360]],"bankingDeg":0,"quality":{"stationing":"mapped-